### WAD files: NEVER commit any. ###
# Wads-DONOTSHIP/ holds commercial id Software data (DOOM.WAD, DOOM2.WAD, ...)
# that must not be redistributed. Freedoom is BSD-licensed and could be shipped,
# but at ~28MB each it does not belong in git either. Tests find them on disk and
# skip when they are absent.
*.[wW][aA][dD]
/Wads-DONOTSHIP/

### Gradle ###
.gradle
# Rooted: a bare "build/" also swallows the com.sablednah.wadcraft.build package.
/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

